==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage may sound easy to you if you've just beaten [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3 [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]], but there, you had a near infinite source of money from the enemies that appeared. Here, your only source of money is the Doge Darks, which are arguably stronger than most, if not all the enemies in Chapter 3 Moon.

Hold off the Those Guys and Doge Darks in the beginning for as long as possible to save money, because once you hit the base, Teacher Bun Bun will appear with several Doge Darks. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] are all incredibly useful here; use a similar strategy to the one you used for EoC 3 Moon.

